+/**
+ * Scale a non-negative decimal string by 10^exp using exact digit shifting
+ * (avoids float error such as 2.01 * 1e3 = 2009.9999999999998), flooring
+ * fractional bytes.
+ *
+ * @param {string} num digits with optional fraction, no sign
+ * @param {number} exp
+ * @param {boolean} negative
+ * @returns {number}
+ * @private
